WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:06.000
Conformity,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:18.800
an invisible force that only exists in the&nbsp;
mind. [Music] It shapes the way we move and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:30.120
washes color into gray. But as time breaks and&nbsp;
sound stretches, reality begins to echo. [Music]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:43.181
As a pulse emerges that refuses to sync,

00:00:43.181 --> 00:00:51.360
[Music] [Applause] a fracture in the perfect mold.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:59.760
an answer in a sea of questions.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:17.440
And as the weight begins to&nbsp;
lift, the echoes start to fade.

00:01:18.584 --> 00:01:19.584
[Applause]

00:01:19.584 --> 00:01:21.084
[Music]

